096993,"x":0.013071896107177673,"y":0.40697674416621776,"text":"1 Complete the text with the words from the box."},{"x":0.054466234689063031,"text":"count sheep eye drops fall feel dizzy","y":0.43313953521514414,"w":0.31590412139892576,"h":0.013110464811325162},{"text":"feel sick injured","y":0.44749999965103504,"x":0.054466232003365284,"h":0.013333333730697672,"w":0.12854030609130859},{"y":0.44750000012963764,"x":0.19389978212833675,"h":0.011802325248718271,"text":"insomnia nosebleed","w":0.16993463516235352},{"h":0.010174418290456178,"x":0.056644881404355869,"y":0.46511627910574094,"w":0.043572983741760253,"text":"pain"},{"y":0.46366279056156656,"h":0.011753876209259051,"text":"sore symptoms","w":0.1350762462615967,"x":0.10021786880819945},{"h":0.0118313952287038,"text":"Doctor, I'm lucky to be still alive. When I watch YouTube","y":0.48691860460226433,"w":0.40958606719970703,"x":0.039215685092956816},{"text":"videos on my phone for just four hours, my eyes get sore.","w":0.40522872924804687,"h":0.013333333333333308,"x":0.039215707489266088,"y":0.50124999998726061},{"h":0.011782945791880328,"text":"Surfing the Internet for ten hours gives me a terrible","x":0.039215688820744887,"w":0.38344226837158202,"y":0.51583333321050662},{"text":"in my back. When I watch TV series for","w":0.2897603416442871,"h":0.011734495957692492,"x":0.15686275339717362,"y":0.53041666677531463},{"h":0.013081394831339521,"x":0.039215688800141847,"y":0.54360465125802215,"text":"only two or three hours, I start to?","w":0.25272331237792967},{"x":0.40305010926460155,"y":0.54505813952240756,"w":0.030501089096069356,"h":0.010174418290456066,"text":"and"},{"x":0.037037043914941316,"h":0.011666666666666714,"y":0.55958333317560882,"text":"have to lie down. What's more, I've started to get allergy","w":0.42047927856445305},{"w":0.010893245935440062,"h":0.010174418290456178,"y":0.57122093022008202,"text":"3","x":0.037037037054066461},{"x":0.1568627512742318,"y":0.57412790694964799,"w":0.29629629135131841,"h":0.011705426375071215,"text":"to the crisps I munch on when watching"},{"x":0.03921568263454734,"y":0.58708333316981598,"text":"TV. My eyes are burning and I need to use","w":0.31154684066772459,"h":0.013333333333333308},{"text":"to feel better.","x":0.15686274684044893,"y":0.60319767464837659,"w":0.10239650726318361,"h":0.010174418290456178},{"text":"Sometimes l even 5","x":0.039215690572139347,"y":0.61624999982342976,"w":0.14379084587097168,"h":0.010203488270441707},{"x":0.2941176471625534,"h":0.011627906958262102,"w":0.14379084587097168,"text":"and can't drink any","y":0.61773255822145035},{"h":0.013081394831339521,"y":0.63081395377134564,"x":0.037037043269183272,"w":0.41394332885742186,"text":"fizzy drinks. When I have PE lessons, I sweat doing even"},{"text":"the simplest exercise, and","w":0.20294004440307614,"y":0.64528370316764583,"h":0.013619712193806977,"x":0.039068535309820067},{"x":0.35507103696903597,"h":0.010504111448923714,"text":"over a lot,","y":0.64809096751730766,"w":0.076350302696228056},{"h":0.011782945791880217,"text":"especially when we play team sports. Last week I had","y":0.65988372102668291,"x":0.039215679735011763,"w":0.392156867980957},{"y":0.67583333346944108,"text":"_, which was so embarrassing because","w":0.28540304183959964,"h":0.011666666666666714,"x":0.16339869218840658},{"h":0.0118313952287038,"text":"it caused so much fuss. But nights are even worse. After","x":0.039215703545145184,"w":0.4139433288574218,"y":0.68875000005275278},{"text":"a good supper, I can't get to sleep. I8","y":0.70203488385855506,"x":0.039215695758142918,"w":0.28104574203491206,"h":0.013081394831339521},{"y":0.70348837212294069,"x":0.4291939002889496,"h":0.010174418290456066,"text":"for","w":0.026143789291381836},{"h":0.013333332935968945,"y":0.71791666683942523,"text":"hours and nothing. Could it be the beginning of","x":0.039215692842650501,"w":0.35729846954345701},{"w":0.16993463516235349,"h":0.01168604652086902,"x":0.15686274494605648,"y":0.73250000002996751,"text":"? I'm already very tired"},{"w":0.33333332061767579,"text":"As l am obviously seriously ill, please exempt","y":0.74708333319741127,"x":0.039215689299005305,"h":0.011666666666666603},{"x":0.039215689127103451,"text":"me from my PE lessons. I am afraid I will get","w":0.32679737091064454,"h":0.013333332935969056,"y":0.76000000035492066},{"x":0.039215686555150189,"w":0.013071894645690918,"h":0.0072674417495727228,"y":0.77470930232046553,"text":"10"},{"w":0.078431372642517094,"x":0.16339869374410093,"text":"otherwise.","y":0.77616279083660333,"h":0.010174418290456178},{"x":0.7799564257057543,"y":0.0087209306275025655,"w":0.15904139518737792,"h":0.020348836580912244,"text":"EXERCISES"},{"text":"2 Complete the definitions.","y":0.065406976753427104,"x":0.48583878701030914,"w":0.22875816345214839,"h":0.011676356395085574},{"x":0.53812636606590247,"y":0.084166666390689593,"text":"You probably have it when you sneeze and cough","w":0.37037036895751951,"h":0.013333333730697672},{"y":0.098572095725463216,"w":0.28128070831298824,"h":0.0140589427947998,"text":"when certain plants bloom. hay fever","x":0.53582298238296944},{"h":0.0087209304173786473,"y":0.11482558124479902,"w":0.013071894645690918,"text":"1","x":0.51198257132639202},{"text":"You do it when you make a loud noise while sleeping.","w":0.4008714294433593,"y":0.11482558145303945,"h":0.011627906958262213,"x":0.53594773422530639},{"w":0.01525054454803465,"x":0.5098039215168324,"text":"2","y":0.1438953488247332,"h":0.010174418290456178},{"text":"It's a disease that affects a particular part of your","x":0.53376905845190659,"w":0.36601306915283205,"y":0.14374999961761947,"h":0.013333333730697672},{"x":0.53812637653040429,"h":0.011782945791880328,"text":"body and is caused by a virus or bacteria.","y":0.15988372093947356,"w":0.3115468215942383},{"h":0.010174418290456178,"w":0.01525054454803465,"x":0.50980392171654187,"text":"3","y":0.19040697698607034},{"y":0.18874999998726072,"h":0.01333333333333330